WEBVTT

01:41.009 --> 01:45.700
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.180 --> 01:50.770
[Episode 7]

01:54.180 --> 01:56.570
[Li Family's Dye Workshop]

02:11.600 --> 02:12.630
After you leave,

02:14.680 --> 02:16.120
be sure to be a good demon.

02:28.630 --> 02:29.840
Xiaowu,

02:31.430 --> 02:32.930
I killed someone.

02:34.310 --> 02:36.310
I'm not a good demon anymore.

02:37.150 --> 02:38.470
What should I do?

02:38.750 --> 02:40.680
A life for a life.

02:41.030 --> 02:43.160
What else can you do?

02:48.310 --> 02:49.150
Little demon,

02:50.150 --> 02:52.400
you've made it hard for me to find you.

03:02.430 --> 03:03.520
Hiding, are you?

03:03.870 --> 03:05.030
Not coming out, huh?

03:05.680 --> 03:07.490
Then let me ask you a question.

03:07.810 --> 03:10.630
This benefactor you keep talking about,

03:11.630 --> 03:14.240
is his name Mu Renzhi?

03:15.000 --> 03:16.230
Oh no.

03:17.079 --> 03:18.150
Not answering?

03:18.630 --> 03:20.000
Then I'll go back now

03:20.000 --> 03:22.430
and dismember your so-called benefactor's

03:22.430 --> 03:24.590
hands, arms,

03:26.030 --> 03:27.520
and legs!

03:45.910 --> 03:46.590
You...

03:47.800 --> 03:49.520
What have you done to Xiaowu?

03:50.520 --> 03:51.579
What's have I done?

03:52.079 --> 03:54.060
He's at the Inspection Bureau now.

03:54.120 --> 03:55.750
If you want him to live,

03:55.840 --> 03:57.590
obediently hand over the demon-controlling talisman

03:57.590 --> 03:58.630
you stole.

04:09.610 --> 04:10.470
Sir.

04:45.520 --> 04:46.460
Little demon,

04:46.920 --> 04:50.050
I'm giving you a chance to take your own life out of guilt.

04:54.240 --> 04:55.120
What's wrong?

04:55.720 --> 04:58.140
Can't bear to hurt yourself?

05:01.160 --> 05:02.190
Pick it up.

05:10.040 --> 05:11.190
Stab yourself.

05:24.270 --> 05:26.430
Come on, stab!

05:44.870 --> 05:46.070
Young Master Wangquan,

05:46.070 --> 05:47.510
we are carrying out our official duty

05:47.510 --> 05:49.110
to arrest a murderous demon.

05:49.240 --> 05:50.840
We'll take this person back.

05:51.040 --> 05:52.020
You may withdraw.

05:52.020 --> 05:53.000
Young Master,

05:53.040 --> 05:55.310
the Inspection Bureau has always been independent of the Yiqi Alliance.

05:55.310 --> 05:56.750
I'm afraid

05:56.920 --> 05:58.780
your actions are inappropriate.

06:05.510 --> 06:06.270
Very well.

06:07.570 --> 06:09.700
I will obey the Young Master's orders.

06:09.950 --> 06:11.550
You may take the person away.

06:14.330 --> 06:16.660
Stab that woman in front.

06:25.360 --> 06:26.420
What are you doing?

06:26.600 --> 06:28.310
I didn't mean to.

06:28.510 --> 06:31.240
I'm controlled by the demon-controlling talisman.

06:31.240 --> 06:32.560
Lowly demon,

06:32.560 --> 06:34.010
die!

06:45.120 --> 06:46.659
Just you wait!

06:48.870 --> 06:51.120
You spent tens of thousands of my silver

06:51.680 --> 06:54.500
and only bought these demon-controlling talismans?

06:54.500 --> 06:56.360
Liuyun Pavilion has been under tight surveillance lately.

06:56.360 --> 06:59.020
Getting these is already quite an achievement.

06:59.290 --> 07:04.150
With a demon-controlling talisman, one can activate it

07:04.510 --> 07:06.830
and force demons to do anything.

07:06.920 --> 07:08.360
If a demon resists,

07:08.430 --> 07:10.670
the talisman can be burned,

07:10.920 --> 07:13.550
and the demon will self-immolate.

07:14.040 --> 07:17.510
Isn't the person who made this

07:18.550 --> 07:20.520
a genius?

07:21.720 --> 07:25.160
Countless noble families secretly use demon-controlling talismans.

07:25.160 --> 07:27.510
Only the Wangquan family fails to recognize their value,

07:27.510 --> 07:29.250
clinging to the position of Alliance Leader

07:29.250 --> 07:31.750
and constantly banning demon-controlling talismans.

07:31.750 --> 07:32.390
Master.

07:40.120 --> 07:41.260
Master Nangong,

07:41.290 --> 07:43.790
I have been very disrespectful today.

07:44.000 --> 07:45.750
My father specifically sent me

07:45.800 --> 07:48.760
to apologize to you, Master.

07:49.630 --> 07:50.390
What?

07:50.930 --> 07:52.400
The mine was sealed,

07:52.680 --> 07:54.480
and the Yang family got anxious?

07:55.360 --> 07:56.750
Apologize?

07:56.830 --> 07:58.920
Your family is in big trouble now.

08:07.870 --> 08:09.160
What time is it?

08:09.360 --> 08:10.240
Who's there?

08:11.000 --> 08:12.560
Mr. Liu, it's me.

08:15.630 --> 08:16.720
Miss Huaizhu?

08:27.430 --> 08:28.530
Alright, alright.

08:28.680 --> 08:30.070
The medicine has taken effect.

08:30.070 --> 08:31.800
The burns to his internal organs

08:31.800 --> 08:33.270
have a chance to heal now.

08:34.270 --> 08:36.750
However, he can't be moved for now.

08:37.030 --> 08:37.960
There's no rush.

08:38.440 --> 08:40.039
We'll wait until he wakes up.

08:40.440 --> 08:41.130
Sir,

08:41.669 --> 08:43.750
please bring some more medicine for external wounds.

08:43.750 --> 08:45.240
Then you can go and rest.

08:45.490 --> 08:46.790
I'll stay and watch over the patient.

08:46.790 --> 08:47.590
Alright then.

08:52.870 --> 08:54.670
I'm sorry for the trouble today.

08:55.240 --> 08:56.510
What trouble?

08:57.310 --> 08:59.040
You were the one who came with me

08:59.750 --> 09:02.010
and couldn't even complete our wedding.

09:02.250 --> 09:03.910
When you think about it later,

09:04.720 --> 09:06.450
you'll probably feel a bit sad.

09:09.750 --> 09:12.510
If I feel sad, I'll blame you.

09:13.120 --> 09:14.980
You'll have to put up with it then.

09:18.720 --> 09:19.320
Okay,

09:20.270 --> 09:21.000
I'll bear it.

09:22.720 --> 09:24.910
These two are showing off their love so much.

09:24.910 --> 09:25.670
What should I,

09:25.670 --> 09:27.870
a girl who hasn't found her ideal man yet,

09:27.870 --> 09:28.900
do about it?

09:30.080 --> 09:30.870
What?

09:31.550 --> 09:34.030
Isn't our Yitan considered an ideal man?

09:34.890 --> 09:35.950
Have a seat, Yitan.

09:38.610 --> 09:40.000
Our Yitan

09:40.000 --> 09:41.540
is indeed handsome,

09:41.600 --> 09:43.840
but whenever I see him,

09:43.840 --> 09:46.030
I think of when we were little and played together

09:46.030 --> 09:47.510
in the mud.

09:49.750 --> 09:51.550
That's clearly because you beat me black and blue

09:51.550 --> 09:53.280
and forced me to play in the mud.

09:53.960 --> 09:54.630
Thank you.

09:56.240 --> 09:57.000
If you're tired,

09:57.000 --> 09:57.510
go rest.

09:57.510 --> 09:58.110
Thank you.

09:58.440 --> 10:00.630
I'll keep watch over Aunt and Uncle here.

10:00.630 --> 10:02.960
So you don't have to keep talking about me.

10:03.030 --> 10:04.030
It's fine.

10:04.320 --> 10:05.520
I promised my brother

10:05.790 --> 10:07.150
that before he returns,

10:07.240 --> 10:10.440
I will definitely protect all of you.

10:10.870 --> 10:12.360
Everyone must be hungry.

10:12.790 --> 10:14.320
These rice wine and osmanthus tangyuan

10:14.320 --> 10:15.840
are our chef's specialty.

10:16.000 --> 10:17.600
Everyone, please have some to tide you over.

10:17.600 --> 10:19.400
Perfect, we're all a bit hungry.

10:28.150 --> 10:30.670
It's just a small wound, nothing to worry about.

10:30.670 --> 10:32.030
Every year, there are many

10:32.030 --> 10:34.030
heroes like you who try to act tough.

10:34.670 --> 10:35.870
They say it's nothing

10:36.390 --> 10:38.190
but end up with blood poisoning.

10:39.390 --> 10:40.390
Let me take a look.

11:25.030 --> 11:25.720
I'm sorry.

11:26.630 --> 11:27.550
I'm used to it.

11:29.790 --> 11:30.630
Actually,

11:31.120 --> 11:32.450
it does hurt quite a bit.

11:35.360 --> 11:37.490
Thank you for your help, Young Master.

11:39.510 --> 11:41.960
If your next line is "I'll repay this debt,"

11:42.840 --> 11:44.040
then there's no need.

11:44.790 --> 11:46.650
Actually, that kind of technique

11:46.870 --> 11:48.530
couldn't have hurt you at all.

11:48.840 --> 11:50.080
I was just meddling.

11:50.390 --> 11:51.240
I know

11:51.780 --> 11:53.310
that you weren't meddling.

11:54.920 --> 11:56.310
The "thank you" just now

11:56.670 --> 11:57.600
was sincere.

12:11.960 --> 12:12.790
If you

12:13.320 --> 12:14.670
truly want to thank me,

12:15.630 --> 12:16.440
then…

12:18.190 --> 12:19.700
[Safflower Medicinal Wine]

12:19.910 --> 12:21.840
Then why don't you offer me a drink?

12:21.910 --> 12:23.310
Young Master, I'm afraid

12:23.440 --> 12:25.320
it's inappropriate for you to drink now.

12:25.320 --> 12:26.910
The safflower medicinal wine

12:26.910 --> 12:29.240
doesn't really count as alcohol, does it?

12:53.360 --> 12:55.560
Miss Huaizhu, you treated me to a drink,

12:56.380 --> 12:58.010
but it's actually for me to watch you

12:58.010 --> 12:59.090
drink alone?

13:00.120 --> 13:01.390
Sometimes I feel

13:02.120 --> 13:03.600
that there is

13:04.240 --> 13:06.300
more than one of you inside your body.

13:06.960 --> 13:09.240
One of me is cunning and scheming,

13:09.790 --> 13:11.150
making you avoid me.

13:13.080 --> 13:14.480
What about the other one?

13:19.320 --> 13:20.360
Why are you up?

13:26.720 --> 13:28.750
You're seriously injured, Chu Jing.

13:28.750 --> 13:30.480
You should go back and lie down.

13:30.740 --> 13:34.820
I only killed because I was controlled by the demon-controlling talisman.

13:34.820 --> 13:36.620
It doesn't matter if I die.

13:36.870 --> 13:38.870
I was going to die in the mine anyway.

13:40.380 --> 13:41.650
But I beg you…

13:42.510 --> 13:43.510
Please

13:43.910 --> 13:45.820
save Xiaowu.

13:45.910 --> 13:47.320
Xiaowu, he...

13:48.310 --> 13:52.360
He's the kindest and most gentle person in the world.

13:53.360 --> 13:54.790
Chu Jing, you're not well.

13:54.790 --> 13:55.650
Get up to speak.

13:55.670 --> 13:56.510
It's alright.

13:57.630 --> 13:58.760
I'm used to the pain.

13:59.600 --> 14:01.000
I'm used to kneeling too.

14:03.120 --> 14:05.080
Alright, since you insist,

14:05.390 --> 14:06.190
we'll listen.

14:08.080 --> 14:08.910
How did you

14:09.510 --> 14:10.390
meet Xiaowu?

14:12.840 --> 14:13.670
Do you know

14:14.870 --> 14:15.870
what

14:16.320 --> 14:17.910
"Chu Jing" means?

14:20.000 --> 14:20.550
Hit him!

14:24.280 --> 14:26.880
You dare to grow heartbreak grass in the mine?

14:27.330 --> 14:28.650
Are you trying to poison someone?

14:28.650 --> 14:30.180
Are you planning to escape?

14:30.270 --> 14:31.120
No.

14:31.670 --> 14:33.070
I don't know what this is.

14:33.550 --> 14:35.410
I just wanted to grow something.

14:35.720 --> 14:36.950
This is the only thing

14:37.030 --> 14:38.510
I could find to grow here.

14:38.600 --> 14:40.630
You won't learn until you're at death's door.

14:40.630 --> 14:41.440
Keep hitting.

14:42.870 --> 14:43.520
Stop!

14:48.840 --> 14:50.500
This isn't heartbreak grass.

14:50.600 --> 14:53.600
It's just a strangler fig that looks similar to heartbreak grass.

14:53.600 --> 14:54.460
You may go now.

14:54.920 --> 14:55.340
Yes.

14:55.390 --> 14:55.940
Yes.

14:57.790 --> 14:58.870
What are you looking at?

14:58.870 --> 14:59.150
Get going!

14:59.150 --> 14:59.630
Get lost!

14:59.630 --> 15:00.000
Get back to work!

15:00.000 --> 15:00.930
Get back to work!

15:08.270 --> 15:09.320
What's your name?

15:14.000 --> 15:14.840
Chu Jing.

15:16.390 --> 15:17.600
My name is Chu Jing.

15:18.270 --> 15:20.870
I'm a carp demon

15:21.270 --> 15:23.790
responsible for surveying the earth's veins in the cave.

15:23.790 --> 15:24.630
Chu Jing...

15:36.520 --> 15:37.570
Do you know

15:38.120 --> 15:39.670
what "Chu Jing" means?

15:41.760 --> 15:43.060
I don't know.

15:48.440 --> 15:49.240
This flower

15:49.670 --> 15:50.670
is a sunflower.

15:56.910 --> 15:57.550
"Chu Jing"

15:59.440 --> 16:00.720
means "sun."

16:03.720 --> 16:04.850
I've looked into it.

16:05.030 --> 16:06.360
Your mother was captured and brought

16:06.360 --> 16:08.510
to the cave when she was pregnant with you.

16:08.510 --> 16:09.960
You were born in the cave,

16:10.120 --> 16:10.850
weren't you?

16:15.380 --> 16:16.190
"Chu Jing"

16:17.320 --> 16:18.840
means "sun."

16:21.080 --> 16:22.440
It's the sun

16:23.560 --> 16:25.690
you've never seen in your entire life.

16:30.320 --> 16:31.120
The sun…

16:42.960 --> 16:44.560
What are you thinking about?

16:45.510 --> 16:46.360
Well,

16:47.410 --> 16:49.180
there's no rain in this mine,

16:49.670 --> 16:51.390
and you have no water for the plants.

16:51.390 --> 16:52.780
How do you make them

16:52.960 --> 16:54.120
thrive so well?

16:55.000 --> 16:55.910
Xiaowu,

16:56.600 --> 16:58.510
let me tell you a secret.

17:44.750 --> 17:46.610
You can control the wind and rain?

17:46.970 --> 17:49.230
Isn't that a skill only dragons possess?

17:50.510 --> 17:54.970
We carp demons are born from absorbing the spiritual energy of heaven and earth,

17:55.350 --> 17:57.150
so we can perform some magic too.

17:57.550 --> 17:59.250
We're not as powerful as dragons,

17:59.250 --> 18:00.180
but my mother...

18:02.680 --> 18:04.840
Before she died, she said

18:05.070 --> 18:07.000
she was originally a priestess in our tribe

18:07.000 --> 18:08.440
and was very powerful.

18:12.640 --> 18:13.400
Then,

18:14.000 --> 18:15.130
can you make it snow?

18:15.380 --> 18:16.810
Snowing is difficult.

18:17.240 --> 18:18.900
Even my mother couldn't do it.

18:20.670 --> 18:22.080
That's a pity.

18:22.880 --> 18:25.660
I grew up in the south.

18:25.830 --> 18:27.230
I've always wished

18:27.350 --> 18:29.160
to see a heavy snowfall.

18:31.770 --> 18:32.930
I can try.

19:08.010 --> 19:08.900
Chu Jing!

19:15.110 --> 19:18.350
Carp demons rely on the spiritual energy of heaven and earth to survive.

19:18.350 --> 19:19.350
Being confined in this mine like this,

19:19.350 --> 19:20.550
they won't live long.

19:20.920 --> 19:22.770
If they can't live, let them die.

19:23.240 --> 19:24.300
We'll capture more

19:24.300 --> 19:26.350
for our mineral vein exploration.

19:28.810 --> 19:29.850
Do demon lives

19:31.680 --> 19:32.960
not matter?

19:37.720 --> 19:38.510
Mu Renzhi,

19:39.510 --> 19:40.640
I'm warning you.

19:41.950 --> 19:44.960
The enmity between humans and demons is irreconcilable.

19:44.960 --> 19:46.240
Sympathizing with demons

19:46.240 --> 19:48.300
is a major taboo in the Yiqi Alliance.

19:49.070 --> 19:50.040
These demons

19:50.160 --> 19:52.820
were all purchased from the Inspection Bureau.

19:52.820 --> 19:55.740
Each one is registered in the Huntian Prison.

19:55.920 --> 19:58.640
Don't you dare have any crooked thoughts.

20:10.790 --> 20:11.920
Take your medicine.

20:12.310 --> 20:13.440
When you're better,

20:13.640 --> 20:14.560
you'll have

20:14.790 --> 20:16.440
many more flowers to plant.

20:22.020 --> 20:23.020
After you get out,

20:24.880 --> 20:26.510
you must be a good demon.

20:31.520 --> 20:32.700
Xiaowu,

20:33.920 --> 20:35.110
I probably

20:36.640 --> 20:38.550
won't be able to get out.

20:40.030 --> 20:42.160
After my parents coughed up blood,

20:43.790 --> 20:45.510
they passed away quickly.

20:47.920 --> 20:48.680
I probably

20:51.030 --> 20:53.270
won't get to see the sun.

20:55.510 --> 20:56.550
But Xiaowu,

20:57.830 --> 20:58.830
you definitely…

21:00.510 --> 21:02.510
definitely will be able to see snow.

21:13.030 --> 21:13.830
Later,

21:15.400 --> 21:18.290
Xiaowu secretly released me.

21:19.110 --> 21:20.170
After getting out,

21:21.550 --> 21:23.400
I went to Master Zhou's place

21:23.920 --> 21:25.680
and became a gardener

21:26.400 --> 21:27.790
in his garden.

21:30.790 --> 21:31.640
After that…

21:33.750 --> 21:36.240
After that, they came.

21:36.510 --> 21:37.300
They...

21:37.970 --> 21:40.350
They forced me to swallow a demon-controlling talisman.

21:40.350 --> 21:41.550
They even forced me

21:43.400 --> 21:44.550
to kill someone.

21:54.470 --> 21:56.770
Do you see these people in front of you?

21:57.720 --> 21:58.860
Pick any one of them

21:59.500 --> 22:00.620
and kill them.

22:11.440 --> 22:12.530
No, I can't.

22:12.640 --> 22:13.670
No.

22:13.880 --> 22:15.570
I can't kill people.

22:20.880 --> 22:22.960
Pick one.

22:23.070 --> 22:25.050
Kill him.

22:28.400 --> 22:29.400
Come and buy vegetables!

22:29.400 --> 22:31.180
Get lost!

22:40.340 --> 22:41.360
Please, I beg you.

22:41.830 --> 22:42.980
Get out of the way.

22:43.090 --> 22:44.750
I don't want to hurt you.

22:45.510 --> 22:47.040
What are you talking about?

22:49.400 --> 22:51.120
Do you have a death wish?

23:15.290 --> 23:17.150
Kill him too.

23:17.310 --> 23:18.920
Do it now!

23:21.750 --> 23:22.550
Run!

23:23.790 --> 23:24.510
Run!

24:01.640 --> 24:03.220
You murderous demon!

24:03.350 --> 24:04.550
Come with me.

24:11.750 --> 24:12.460
Trying to run?

24:12.460 --> 24:13.330
After him!

24:14.440 --> 24:15.400
I can't resist

24:16.230 --> 24:17.880
the demon-controlling talisman.

24:17.880 --> 24:18.680
Don't worry.

24:19.510 --> 24:21.310
That half-burned mother talisman

24:21.310 --> 24:22.510
is in my hands now.

24:23.240 --> 24:24.680
The evidence is irrefutable.

24:24.680 --> 24:25.640
They won't get away.

24:25.640 --> 24:26.880
What about Xiaowu?

24:27.400 --> 24:29.000
He said Xiaowu was captured.

24:29.900 --> 24:31.680
When Xiaowu let me go,

24:31.790 --> 24:33.190
he repeatedly assured me

24:34.350 --> 24:36.270
that no one would find out.

24:37.960 --> 24:39.960
Mu Xiaowu came from a poor background,

24:39.960 --> 24:41.960
but he's hardworking and diligent.

24:41.960 --> 24:44.720
He became the mine tunnel leader at a young age.

24:45.350 --> 24:47.080
Many people are jealous of him.

24:47.410 --> 24:49.750
Someone reported you.

24:50.400 --> 24:51.720
How could this happen?

24:52.160 --> 24:53.790
Xiaowu can't be in trouble.

24:54.590 --> 24:56.440
He has a beautiful fiancée.

24:56.720 --> 24:58.070
What can I do to save him?

25:02.350 --> 25:03.680
I can go back to the mine.

25:03.680 --> 25:04.240
Please

25:04.530 --> 25:05.960
send me back to the mine!

25:05.960 --> 25:06.350
Chu Jing.

25:06.350 --> 25:06.790
I beg you all!

25:06.790 --> 25:07.690
Chu Jing!

25:08.880 --> 25:10.810
You won't be going back to the mine.

25:11.270 --> 25:12.590
I'll help you

25:12.960 --> 25:14.160
protect Xiaowu.

25:14.720 --> 25:15.440
Okay?

25:17.250 --> 25:18.240
Really?

25:20.440 --> 25:21.440
My word is my bond.

25:27.440 --> 25:33.320
[Clairvoyant Yang Residence]

26:03.880 --> 26:04.680
Ying.

26:05.300 --> 26:06.170
Ying.

26:07.550 --> 26:09.640
I forgot you don't eat osmanthus.

26:10.830 --> 26:13.760
I put the sleeping drug in the osmanthus honey.

26:14.030 --> 26:16.470
But the honey has dissolved in the soup.

26:16.610 --> 26:18.140
You won't be awake for long.

26:19.350 --> 26:20.530
Why are you doing this?

26:20.530 --> 26:21.990
I have no choice.

26:22.160 --> 26:23.420
Nangong Chui threatened me

26:23.420 --> 26:25.880
that I must deliver Mu Xiaowu to him tonight.

26:26.070 --> 26:27.770
Otherwise, the grudge between him and the Yang family

26:27.770 --> 26:29.440
will be formed.

26:29.750 --> 26:30.830
You know,

26:30.960 --> 26:33.400
even though the Nangong family lost Nangong Ye,

26:33.400 --> 26:35.460
they're still powerful and wealthy.

26:35.640 --> 26:37.240
We can't afford to offend them.

26:37.240 --> 26:38.270
Ying,

26:38.550 --> 26:40.810
Young Master Wangquan won't let you off.

26:41.550 --> 26:43.400
He's just a mine tunnel leader.

26:43.590 --> 26:46.590
Sending him over doesn't necessarily mean he'll die.

26:47.550 --> 26:50.510
How can Young Master Wangquan not spare the Yang family?

26:50.510 --> 26:52.030
Isn't Yitan still here?

26:54.790 --> 26:55.160
Ying.

26:55.160 --> 26:55.960
Take him away.

26:56.160 --> 26:56.960
Ying.

26:57.830 --> 26:59.680
No, no!

27:02.160 --> 27:02.790
No!

27:05.400 --> 27:06.070
Ying.

27:06.720 --> 27:07.850
Ying, don't do this.

27:09.070 --> 27:10.930
Xiaowu, Xiaowu.

27:11.240 --> 27:12.270
Xiaowu.

27:13.880 --> 27:14.640
Let go.

27:15.510 --> 27:16.510
Xiaowu!

27:18.270 --> 27:19.640
I really don't understand.

27:19.640 --> 27:21.580
What's so good about this poor boy?

27:21.880 --> 27:23.590
Why are you so devoted to him?

27:24.140 --> 27:25.610
I want to see Father.

27:26.000 --> 27:27.130
I want to see Father.

27:27.680 --> 27:28.800
Ying.

27:28.960 --> 27:29.770
Ying!

27:29.880 --> 27:31.750
Do you really think I would dare to drug you all

27:31.750 --> 27:33.420
and send him to the Inspection Bureau

27:33.420 --> 27:35.230
without Father's permission?

27:50.550 --> 27:53.030
The demon and the fragments of the demon-controlling talisman

27:53.030 --> 27:55.590
have all been taken away by Wangquan Hongye.

27:56.350 --> 27:59.640
Isn't this just handing over the evidence

28:00.350 --> 28:02.920
and waiting for him to come after us?

28:03.550 --> 28:04.440
Master,

28:04.550 --> 28:06.240
that little demon was so badly injured.

28:06.240 --> 28:08.550
It shouldn't be able to come back so quickly.

28:08.550 --> 28:09.240
Thanks to the Yang family

28:09.240 --> 28:11.040
for sending us such a great gift,

28:11.510 --> 28:12.770
we still have a chance.

28:13.000 --> 28:14.440
What chance?

28:15.270 --> 28:17.160
From this boy's mouth, we can get

28:17.510 --> 28:19.640
evidence of the Yang family's collusion with demons.

28:19.640 --> 28:21.590
When the Yiqi Alliance meeting comes,

28:21.590 --> 28:23.450
we can set up the Wangquan family.

28:23.880 --> 28:25.280
Let's see what kind of dog

28:25.310 --> 28:27.840
Wangquan Hongye is trying so hard to protect.

28:27.960 --> 28:29.880
We can also ask the Wangquan family

28:29.880 --> 28:31.480
what their stance really is.

28:31.880 --> 28:33.680
They oppose using demon cores to forge swords

28:33.680 --> 28:35.310
and ban demon-controlling talismans.

28:35.310 --> 28:37.030
Are they demon sympathizers?

28:40.510 --> 28:41.590
Good idea.

28:41.880 --> 28:42.720
Come,

28:42.960 --> 28:44.440
wake him up with water.

28:44.960 --> 28:45.960
Master Nangong.

28:48.400 --> 28:50.540
I usually wake people up

28:50.830 --> 28:52.030
without using water.

31:02.550 --> 31:03.550
It seems

31:03.690 --> 31:05.410
you're afraid of pain too.

31:05.550 --> 31:06.920
Just a petty thief

31:06.920 --> 31:09.160
who has never practiced magic or martial arts.

31:09.160 --> 31:10.820
Of course he's afraid of pain.

31:12.550 --> 31:14.830
What exactly do you want to ask?

31:16.290 --> 31:18.430
I released Chu Jing,

31:19.550 --> 31:21.500
but he would never kill anyone.

31:21.830 --> 31:23.630
Did you release the little demon

31:24.720 --> 31:26.960
on the orders of the Yang family?

31:29.160 --> 31:30.310
Of course not.

31:40.790 --> 31:42.540
The questions I ask you

31:43.030 --> 31:44.920
only need one kind of answer.

31:46.310 --> 31:47.640
Do you understand?

32:00.310 --> 32:01.440
Xiaowu.

32:50.090 --> 32:51.590
I see you.

32:52.260 --> 32:53.670
Wangquan Hongye,

32:54.860 --> 32:57.250
your love is destined to be in vain.

32:57.800 --> 33:00.180
All struggles are futile.

33:00.880 --> 33:01.750
Who are you?

33:02.440 --> 33:03.110
Me?

33:05.510 --> 33:07.360
I am the Eternal Night.

33:09.880 --> 33:12.080
That tree is getting bigger and bigger.

33:12.590 --> 33:14.850
Is the Eternal Night getting closer too?

33:16.270 --> 33:17.730
What kind of place is that?

33:18.510 --> 33:19.350
Father,

33:20.240 --> 33:21.400
where are you?

33:26.160 --> 33:27.400
This place is shabby.

33:28.090 --> 33:29.890
You didn't sleep well all night.

33:30.480 --> 33:32.080
You must've had nightmares.

33:36.350 --> 33:37.550
I added calming herbs

33:37.550 --> 33:38.880
in the medicine for him.

33:38.880 --> 33:40.210
He won't wake up easily.

33:53.750 --> 33:55.160
Probably very few people

33:55.790 --> 33:58.120
were willing to make promises to Chu Jing.

33:58.440 --> 34:00.350
That's why he clung to you.

34:03.070 --> 34:04.570
I didn't expect Mu Xiaowu

34:04.750 --> 34:06.080
to be such a warm person.

34:06.350 --> 34:07.310
Yan said

34:08.280 --> 34:09.360
this man

34:10.000 --> 34:11.760
always keeps his word

34:12.960 --> 34:15.880
and he puts his all into everything he does.

34:17.150 --> 34:18.590
No matter what happens,

34:19.760 --> 34:21.230
just seeing him

34:21.550 --> 34:23.070
feels like coming home,

34:24.070 --> 34:25.929
because he always puts you first,

34:26.360 --> 34:29.510
making you feel like you're basking in spring breeze all the time.

34:29.510 --> 34:30.880
How many people

34:31.280 --> 34:33.210
in the world can receive such care?

34:34.030 --> 34:35.760
Being able to be a gentle person

34:36.590 --> 34:37.989
is also a kind of fortune.

34:43.840 --> 34:44.800
Don't worry.

34:45.510 --> 34:46.550
When he wakes up,

34:46.550 --> 34:48.750
we'll return to the Inspection Bureau.

34:48.920 --> 34:50.980
I will definitely protect Mu Xiaowu.

34:53.030 --> 34:54.630
Let me change your dressing.

35:03.840 --> 35:05.570
The wound is no longer serious,

35:06.360 --> 35:08.800
but it might leave a faint scar.

35:10.000 --> 35:10.840
It's fine.

35:11.710 --> 35:13.040
There's one more thing.

35:14.000 --> 35:15.230
How about I

35:15.230 --> 35:16.670
help detoxify you?

35:17.790 --> 35:18.660
Now?

35:19.030 --> 35:20.510
Please turn your palm up.

35:31.070 --> 35:31.960
It's done.

35:35.760 --> 35:36.710
It's done?

35:37.840 --> 35:39.510
What I gave you last time

35:39.630 --> 35:41.160
was the Golden Flower Pill.

35:44.550 --> 35:46.160
No wonder I haven't felt

35:46.230 --> 35:47.920
any discomfort during this time.

35:47.920 --> 35:49.520
Instead, my mind felt clear.

35:50.590 --> 35:51.880
You are kind-hearted and virtuous,

35:51.880 --> 35:53.510
yet you didn't forget to deceive me

35:53.510 --> 35:54.570
to use as leverage.

35:55.800 --> 35:56.970
After all,

35:57.150 --> 35:58.880
you are Young Master Wangquan.

36:00.360 --> 36:01.550
Then why are you

36:02.110 --> 36:03.880
willing to detoxify me now?

36:04.760 --> 36:05.800
Because you are

36:06.710 --> 36:08.230
somewhat different

36:08.880 --> 36:10.140
from how I had thought.

36:12.670 --> 36:14.070
Then, the me in your heart

36:14.550 --> 36:16.350
and the me your sister speaks of,

36:16.710 --> 36:17.710
are they the same?

36:23.150 --> 36:24.550
At least not anymore.

36:25.400 --> 36:27.010
When this matter is resolved,

36:27.010 --> 36:28.480
I'll make up for the drink

36:28.590 --> 36:29.670
that I owe you.

36:30.400 --> 36:31.670
Then I'll take it

36:31.950 --> 36:33.200
that in your heart,

36:34.070 --> 36:35.800
your opinion of me has changed.

36:38.840 --> 36:40.490
The medicine is almost ready.

36:40.490 --> 36:41.780
After Chu Jing wakes up

36:42.000 --> 36:43.360
and drinks this medicine,

36:43.360 --> 36:44.890
he should be able to travel.

36:45.840 --> 36:47.970
Young Master, please rest for a while.

36:59.000 --> 37:01.400
This child still has a bit of a cough.

37:01.560 --> 37:02.770
This cold medicine

37:02.840 --> 37:04.510
is excellent for preventing colds.

37:04.510 --> 37:06.040
[999 Cold Medicine]

37:04.630 --> 37:06.000
Take it back with you.

37:55.590 --> 37:56.400
Move aside.

37:57.670 --> 37:59.090
I want to see Mu Renzhi.

37:59.510 --> 38:01.630
Mu Renzhi is a serious criminal of the Inspection Bureau.

38:01.630 --> 38:04.030
How can you see him just because you want to?

38:09.490 --> 38:10.710
Move aside!

38:16.150 --> 38:17.900
I am Mu Renzhi's wife.

38:19.210 --> 38:20.710
What crime has he committed?

38:20.710 --> 38:22.010
Let me in.

38:22.210 --> 38:23.670
I'm willing to share his punishment.

38:23.670 --> 38:24.800
The Master said

38:24.800 --> 38:26.150
no one is allowed in

38:26.150 --> 38:27.750
before the culprit is found.

38:34.230 --> 38:35.320
Move aside!

38:36.800 --> 38:37.710
Move aside!

38:38.320 --> 38:39.630
Move aside!

38:47.810 --> 38:49.230
If you dare to make trouble again,

38:49.230 --> 38:52.290
I'll make sure you never see him again in this lifetime.

39:22.630 --> 39:23.510
Why would

39:25.280 --> 39:27.510
the Yang family want me to release Chu Jing?

39:27.510 --> 39:29.640
Because they're demon sympathizers.

39:30.280 --> 39:32.410
Not only are they demon sympathizers,

39:32.430 --> 39:34.670
but the Wangquan family is too.

39:40.820 --> 39:42.260
When I married Yan,

39:43.480 --> 39:44.970
I promised her

39:46.630 --> 39:48.440
that I would keep her safe and happy.

39:48.440 --> 39:50.550
Why are you telling me this nonsense?

39:53.510 --> 39:55.640
If the Yang family falls into trouble,

39:55.860 --> 39:58.200
Yan won't be safe and happy anymore.

40:00.630 --> 40:02.360
I'm poor and lowly,

40:03.550 --> 40:05.880
but I never break promises.

40:09.150 --> 40:11.000
It seems our guest

40:11.960 --> 40:13.510
doesn't know how to behave.

40:22.230 --> 40:23.760
Is this all you've got?

40:30.030 --> 40:31.630
Give him severe punishment.

40:31.920 --> 40:32.590
Yes, sir.

40:47.440 --> 40:48.800
Something has happened to the Yang family.
